# Data / large artifacts
# Ignore the data folder's CONTENTS, but keep the folder + its README on GitHub so the
# data is documented even though the files themselves are never committed.
data/*
!data/README.md
*.parquet
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz

# Notebooks output / scratch
scratch/
outputs/

